===Etymology===
{{suffix|elliptic|al|lang=en}}, from {{etyl|grc|en}} {{m|grc|ἐλλειπτικός}}, from {{m|grc|ἐλλείπω||I leave out, omit}}. Surface analysis {{suffix|ellipse|ical|lang=en}}.

